'''Greymane's Watch''' is a lighthouse found atop the western cliffs of [[Gilneas]], overlooking the [[Baradin Sea]]. It is manned by the spirit of [[Elaroth Ranworth]], who has been cursed long ago to tend to the lighthouse.

